        {
          "text": " Kosodi Seres akeberu ka ikepapero kere atemar ŋes atiar, “Kosipokinai akito aojauke ikubitin akaisakany, kinerut moi ka ekabaka aikajakin Morudekai nen; ŋes konyet ilomaria ka ekabaka ilakara opucit.” Kisiyalamik nin Kaman; kicorak asipokin",
